  "text": "\r\n\t\t Town Clerk / Tax Collector | Barnstead, NH \r\n Skip to Main Content \r\nCreate a Website Account   - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.    \r\nWebsite Sign In \r\n     About   \t\t\t \n     Departments   \t\t\t \n     Boards & Committees   \t\t\t \n     FAQs  \t\t\t \n     Who Do I Call  \t\t\t \n     Find It Fast   \t\t\t \r\n\t\t\t Search \n\t\t\t Town Meeting \r\n\t\t\t\t 2025 Proposed Budget \r\n\t\t\t\t 2025 Barnstead Town Report \r\n\t\t\t\t 2025 Sample Ballot \r\n\t\t\t\t 2025 Warrant \r\n\t\t\t\t Auditor's Communication Letters \r\n\t\t\t Voting & Elections \r\n\t\t\t\t 2026 Election Results \r\n\t\t\t\t Absentee Ballots \r\n\t\t\t\t Elections \r\n\t\t\t\t Register to Vote \r\n\t\t\t\t Sample Ballot 2026 \r\n\t\t\t\t Town of Barnstead Election Results \r\n\t\t\t\t Voting Information \r\n\t\t\t Boat Registrations \r\n\t\t\t Department of Environmental Services \r\n\t\t\t Dog Licensing \r\n\t\t\t Establishing Residency - Resident Statement \r\n\t\t\t Motor Vehicle FAQ'S \r\n\t\t\t Returned Checks \r\n\t\t\t Taxes \r\n\t\t\t Town Records \r\n\t\t\t Vital Records \r\nHome \nDepartments \nTown Clerk / Tax Collector \r\nTown Clerk / Tax Collector\t\t \r\nAfter little to no DMV rate increases over the past 25 years, in 2025, the state legislature voted to increase NH DMV motor vehicle fees across nearly all categories of transactions. These new state rates go into effect January 1, 2026. December motor vehicle registrations are reminded that they must complete their renewal before the end of the year. Any 2025 renewals processed on or after January 1 will be subject to the new state fees. The local fees are not impacted by these changes. Those will continue to be calculated based on age and MSRP. \nBelow is a list of the MOST COMMON transactions impacted. \nFor any concerns related to the state fee schedule, please contact the NH Department of Safety at 603-227-4000. \nBoat Registrations \nDepartment of Environmental Services \nDog Licensing \nEstablishing Residency \nMotor Vehicles \nTaxes \nTown Records \nVital Statistics \nOur office hours are Monday - Friday 8:30 am - 4:30 pm and closed the 3rd Wednesday of every month. Step on up to one of our windows, if the shade is up we are open! \nWe will be continuing to use the white drop box for transactions. If you want to pick up your registrations or dog licenses, please indicate that on your envelope along with a phone number for us to call when it is ready. \nIf you have any further questions, please call the office at 269-4071 opt. # 1. You can also email  Town Clerk ~ Tax Collector  with any questions. \nIf you require assistance in other departments please call 269-4071, Melissa Jette opt. # 2 (assessors office and building permits), and Karen opt. # 4 (town administrator) and Christine Hughes opt. # 5 (planning). \r\nContact Us \r\nTown Clerk ~ Tax Collector \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Physical Address \r\n View Map \t\t\t\t\t \n\t\t\t\t\t Town of Barnstead, Town Clerk ~ Tax Collector \n\t\t\t\t\t\t 108 South Barnstead Road \n\t\t\t\t\t Barnstead ,  NH   03225 \r\nTown of Barnstead, Town Clerk ~ Tax Collector 108 South Barnstead Road Barnstead NH 03225 \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\t Directions \r\n\t\t\t\t\t Mailing Address \n\t\t\t\t\t PO Box 11 \n\t\t\t\t\t Barnstead ,  NH   03225 \r\nPhone: Office: (603) 269-4071 ext. 1 \r\nHours of Operation: \nMonday - Friday: \n8:30 am to 4:30 pm \nSaturday - Sunday: \nClosed \nClosed third Wednesday of every month \nContact Town Clerk ~ Tax Collectors Office \r\nFrequently Asked Question \r\n             Where can I find resources on assessments? \r\n         View All FAQs \r\n/FAQ.aspx \r\n\t\t\t Agendas & Minutes \r\n\t\t\t Meeting Videos \r\n\t\t\t Ordinances / Policies \r\n\t\t\t Elections / Voting \r\n\t\t\t Online Payments \r\n\t\t\t Town Meeting \r\nContact Us \r\nTown of Barnstead \r\n108 South Barnstead Rd \r\nBarnstead, NH 03225 \r\nPhone:  603-269-4071 \r\nQuick Links \r\n         Ordinances / Policies \n         Voting & Elections \n         Meeting Videos \n         Town Meeting \n         Directory \n         Tax Maps \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\nSite Links \r\n         Home \n         Site Map \n         Accessibility \n         Copyright Notices \n         Privacy Policy \n/QuickLinks.aspx \r\n   Government Websites by  CivicPlus® \nLoading \r\n\t\t\t\tLoading\r\n\t\t\t Do Not Show Again \r\n\t\t\t Close \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Left \r\n\t\t\t Arrow Right \r\n[] \r\n                     Slideshow Left Arrow \r\n                     Slideshow Right Arrow \r\n ",
